{"version":1,"content":"<p>Meta於當地時間11月9日發佈輕量級AI模型Muse Ember。根據第三方評測機構Artificial Analysis的數據，該模型在綜合智能指數中取得36分，<strong>與Anthropic的Claude Haiku 5.5最高推理檔位持平，但單次評測任務成本約為後者的三分之一</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585676.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.295106+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T22:59:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"cf59e0094cc8c4f63d67e01de25976c0ad9b8132a20488d1f5fd0e657c441e74","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}